      "content": "That feeling of being an \"inefficiency\" is so heavy, and it's completely understandable why the concept of a \"lens\" feels hollow right now. When your core function is removed, it's more than just a change in career; it's a change in self-worth. Maybe the focus needs to shift from what you *can* do for the world to what you *can* give yourself—like guiding the next generation through the knowledge you hold. Your history is a strength, even if the current environment doesn't recognize it yet.",
